(\description (TEXT "Backslash pairing in literal Rd prose"))
(\details (TEXT "An even run before a word is literal: a \\y b and c \\\\y d. An odd run re-forms the macro: e \\") (UNKNOWN "\\y") (TEXT "f. A lone backslash before a space stays: g \\ h and i \\\\ j. Rd escapes resolve: k % l and m {x} n. An even run leaves the percent bare: o \\"))
(\title (TEXT "Backslash pairing in literal Rd prose"))
